  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n@babolivier has a nice script for pruning retention policies [here](https://gist.github.com/babolivier/64b6b539ce612f44db3171a4c3d4ecaf) that can be useful in other contexts, too (e.g. when bulk-changing room history visibility settings). It might be good to include this in the [\"Admin FAQ\" section](https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/usage/administration/admin_faq.html) of the docs.\r\n\r\nPutting this here as an issue for discussion first in case somebody else knows a better place to host this.",
